WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.734 --> 00:00:19.336
Riley: It's a perfect day for the Pet Lovers Club!

2
00:00:19.337 --> 00:00:20.959
Skyler: Where's Sarah?

3
00:00:20.960 --> 00:00:23.279
Ben: I saw her after school.

4
00:00:23.280 --> 00:00:26.930
She had to go somewhere with her mom.

5
00:00:26.931 --> 00:00:29.776
Theo: Whiskers loves the spring.

6
00:00:29.777 --> 00:00:33.301
He likes rolling in the grass.

7
00:00:33.302 --> 00:00:37.418
Riley: Look! Snooks is digging in the garden.

8
00:00:37.419 --> 00:00:42.960
Mrs. Summers: He'll ruin my rosebushes! Snooks, no!

9
00:00:42.961 --> 00:00:45.884
Skyler: It looks like Snooks found something.

10
00:00:45.885 --> 00:00:48.080
Riley: It's his bone.

11
00:00:48.081 --> 00:00:56.517
He must have buried it there.

12
00:00:56.518 --> 00:00:58.539
Ben: He wants to play tug-of-war.

13
00:00:58.540 --> 00:01:06.910
Snooks: Grrr!

14
00:01:06.911 --> 00:01:09.524
Skyler: Hey, look what I found.

15
00:01:09.525 --> 00:01:11.332
Riley: What is it?

16
00:01:11.333 --> 00:01:15.380
Skyler: I think it's a tiny tooth!

17
00:01:15.381 --> 00:01:18.399
Theo: I wonder who it belongs to.

18
00:01:18.400 --> 00:01:20.406
Ben: I wish it were mine.

19
00:01:20.407 --> 00:01:24.197
I haven't lost a single tooth yet!

20
00:01:24.198 --> 00:01:26.536
Skyler: It's not mine either.

21
00:01:26.537 --> 00:01:29.192
Chatter: My tooth!

22
00:01:29.193 --> 00:01:33.678
Skyler: Silly Chatter! Parrots don't have teeth.

23
00:01:33.679 --> 00:01:36.004
Theo: Then whose tooth is it?

24
00:01:36.005 --> 00:01:42.593
Snooks: Ar-ooo!

25
00:01:42.594 --> 00:01:47.205
Riley: Do you think this is Snooks' tooth?

26
00:01:47.206 --> 00:01:52.344
Skyler: Maybe he lost it while chewing on his bone.

27
00:01:52.345 --> 00:01:56.545
Riley: Snooks, open your mouth.

28
00:01:56.546 --> 00:01:59.714
Theo: Is he missing a tooth?

29
00:01:59.715 --> 00:02:01.871
Riley: I don't know.

30
00:02:01.872 --> 00:02:05.010
It's hard to see in there.

31
00:02:05.011 --> 00:02:08.520
Theo: It must be Snooks' tooth.

32
00:02:08.521 --> 00:02:10.453
Ben: I wish it were mine!

33
00:02:10.454 --> 00:02:15.878
Then I could leave it for the tooth fairy.

34
00:02:15.879 --> 00:02:18.592
Riley: That gives me an idea.

35
00:02:18.593 --> 00:02:27.036
Riley: Let's leave Snooks' tooth for the Dog Tooth Fairy!
